# GCD lattice
# Common divisors form symmetric bands across the signed integer grid.

:mim 1

# Keep zero at the center and make every sign visible.
:axis x integers
:axis y integers

# Each cell contains the greatest common divisor of its coordinates.
:field gcd(x, y)

# Preserve the exact GCD for coloring.
:lens value
:color exact(lens)

# Highlight the cells where both coordinates are equal.
:overlay equality on
